      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        122,
        1179,
        1980,
        1620
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Executive Order 52 was issued in 1967 in order to effectuate\nthe recommendations of the 1966 Tripartite Committee on Labor Relations\nwhich made comprehensive recommendations for procedures to govern collective\nbargaining in the public service and in particular to meet the need for\nindependent and impartial tribunals to settle impasses arising in contract\nnegotiations to resolve grievances, and to determine representation issues; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2835,
          "min": -1.4403
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 94,
          "mean": -0.0052,
          "min": -0.4745
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 20287,
        "area_px": 726768,
        "density": 0.02791,
        "chars": 445,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.94
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124,
        1651,
        1844,
        1858
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, subsequently the New York City Collective Bargaining Law was\namended by Local Law No. 1 of 1973 in relation to some of the subject\nmatters encompassed by Executive Order No. 52; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2603,
          "min": -1.5149
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0051
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6612,
        "area_px": 330372,
        "density": 0.02001,
        "chars": 190,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 28.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        126,
        1886,
        1940,
        2097
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, the five years of experience in labor relations since the\nissuance of Executive Order No. 52 have shown that clarification of the Order\nis desirable; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2616,
          "min": -1.5144
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0074
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6016,
